--------------------------------------------------------------------------
NON-CLINICAL USE DISCLAIMER / 非临床使用声明
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
This software is a research prototype for academic use only. It is NOT a
medical device, has NOT been validated for clinical use, and must NOT be used
to diagnose, screen, stage, or treat any patient or to inform any clinical
decision. All outputs (segmentation masks, Gleason scores, ISUP grades, ROC
statistics) are experimental results produced on a public research dataset.

本软件为学术研究原型，不是医疗器械，未通过任何临床验证，不得用于疾病的
诊断、筛查、分期、治疗或任何临床决策。所有输出（分割掩码、Gleason 评分、
ISUP 分级、ROC 统计）均为公开研究数据集上的实验结果。

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY DATA / 第三方数据
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository contains NO image data. Experiments rely on SICAPv2
(Silva-Rodriguez et al., Mendeley Data, https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/
9xxm58dvs3/1), which must be obtained separately under its own license terms.
See docs/DATA.md for acquisition instructions and citation requirements.

本仓库不包含任何图像数据。实验依赖 SICAPv2 数据集，需按其自身许可单独获取。
获取方式与引用要求见 docs/DATA.md。
